### Definisi Skema Alat Terstandar

```python
calc_tool_schema = {
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "calculator",
        "description": "Mengevaluasi ekspresi matematika aritmatika dasar.",
        "parameters": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "expression": {"type": "string", "description": "Ekspresi aritmatika"}
            },
            "required": ["expression"]
        }
    }
}
```

### Penanganan Galat Tanpa Crash

```python
# Pembungkusan kesalahan menjadi observasi informatif
def dispatch(tool_name, arguments):
    try:
        return execute_tool(tool_name, arguments)
    except ZeroDivisionError:
        return {
            "status": "error", 
            "hint": "Pembagian dengan nol tidak sah. Coba gunakan penyebut lain."
        }
    except Exception as e:
        return {"status": "error", "message": str(e)}
```
